===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ps|en}} {{m|ps|طالبان||students, seekers|tr=ṭālibān}}, plural of {{m|ps|طالب|tr=ṭālib}}, from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|طَالِب||seeker, student}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[Sunni]] [[Islamic]] [[student]] [[movement]] organized in [[Afghanistan]] in 1994 by the [[radical]] [[mullah]] {{w|Mohammed Omar|Mohammad Omar}}.

